&_nc_oc=AdquKruApiEyEkNhn_Y1hsnJEkH9i7sH509s7FmurekNxTh0xAgshA_383AFP86Jy4k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTXDEuof5AdYJdpbvI3KxsUdRr6PYbSBhwkPkqkkTw_RA&oe=6B05A6ED"}, {"file_name": "com.mrspace.deck-20261107-171415_edited_1794093302843.png", "id": "1151931974039535", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312068_1151931977372868_3770955252299948329_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dywx8pT41ZoQ7kNvwE0l-NX&_nc_oc=AdqEkg5dqvnJlqfQwqIxH46yh7YE4G8GLW9G4fwVVNOstJzUOFHlL4zJou6WX58aUfk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQNtA9gxd_itBounsNVIzw33WfX-DQdBjcqFzMXgOuZqA&oe=6B05C735"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "WraithDesk", "keywords": ["MultiMonitor", "Productivity", "PcStreaming"], "long_description": "Bring your Windows PC into your space with WraithDesk, a mixed-reality workspace for Meta Quest.\n\nArrange floating screens around you, place them where they\u2019re comfortable, and keep your real surroundings visible through passthrough. Work, browse, watch, and control your PC from a setup that feels like yours.\n\nMake your workspace your own:\n- Move, resize, rotate, and dock screens.\n- Use controllers or hand tracking to interact.\n- Type with the virtual keyboard and access shortcuts from the hotkey deck.\n- Customize your workspace with themes, colors, and sound-reactive lighting.\n- Optionally forward your headset microphone to your PC.\nWraithDesk connects to its Windows companion over your local network using a pairing process. A Windows PC with a supported hardware video encoder and the free WraithDesk PC companion are required. Additional independent Windows desktops require separately configured virtual-display software.", "short_description": "Bring your Windows PC into mixed reality with floating screens, hand tracking, and customizable controls."}]}, "developer_name": null, "develope